2026-11-28  Reini Urban  <reini.urban@gmail.com>

	decode_r2007: log all objects with -v4
	GH #1585. With -v4 (the prescan) the trace of an r2007 DWG stopped after
	the first object of the rescan. The decoding itself was complete, the
	JSON was identical, only the log went silent: bit_check_CRC syncs the
	global loglevel from dat->opts, and the static obj_dat and hdl_dat of
	the r2007 reader never had their opts set, so the loglevel became 0 at
	the end of the first object. The 2004 reader sets them.

	* src/decode_r2007.c (read_2007_section_handles): Set obj_dat.opts and
	  hdl_dat.opts from dwg->opts.

