	VBA_PROJECT is a stable fixed type (DWG_TYPE_VBA_PROJECT 0x51), not a
	class. But dwg_free_object and dwg_free_object_private only had its case
	under the never defined DEBUG_VBA_PROJECT. So it was freed by the default
	branch as a variable class: "No class for VBA_PROJECT type 81 found", and
	as an unknown object, which does not free its data. An import from DXF or
	JSON leaked them.

	* src/free.c: remove the DEBUG_VBA_PROJECT guards, the generated
	  dwg_free_VBA_PROJECT exists.
	* src/dwg2.spec (VBA_PROJECT): free the data also with a version before
	  r2000, the block with the data is SINCE r2000b, but an import from DXF
	  allocates them for any version.
	* programs/alive.test.in: dxf2dwg of sample_r14.dxf with a VBA_PROJECT
	  added.

	12 bytes leaked and the warning gone with ASan. make -j4 check passes.

2026-11-24  Reini Urban  <reini.urban@gmail.com>

	in_dxf: reconcile the size of a binary 310 field
	GH #1564. The size of a binary TF field, 93 in bits for
	PROXY_OBJECT.data_numbits or 90 in bytes for VBA_PROJECT.data_size, has
	a pair of its own, before or after the 310 chunks. The encoders write the
	data by that size, so a 93 above the data overread it (ASan heap overflow
	in bit_write_bits, dwg_encode_PROXY_OBJECT_private).

	* src/in_dxf.c (dxf_reconcile_binary_size): called once the pairs of an
	  object are read, so the order of the pairs does not matter. An absent
	  size is derived from the data, a size which does not match the bytes
	  of the chunks drops the data with an error. The reversal of the last
	  partial byte of a size in bits moved here, as it needs the final size:
	  it was skipped when the 93 came after the 310.
	* programs/alive.test.in: dxf2dwg of sample_r14.dxf with the 93 of its
	  first ACAD_PROXY_OBJECT raised to 61000.

	Reported as PR #1564 by saddamr3e, implemented without looking at the
	patch. Reproduced with ASan: the 93 of 610 raised to 61000 crashed, now an
	error and the data dropped. The 93 after the 310, and an absent 93, give
	the same objects as the original, 616 bits for the absent one. make -j4
	check passes. A VBA_PROJECT with 90 of 60000 and 5 bytes of 310 is dropped
	too.

