2026-11-19  garcialeal  <garcialeal2@gmail.com>

	api: follow the entity links to the R13-R2000 POLYLINE vertices
	From R13 to R2000 the vertices of a POLYLINE are chained by their
	next_entity links, not by their handles: vertices added later, like the
	fit vertices of a spline-fit POLYLINE, come after the SEQEND.  The
	POLYLINE_2D and POLYLINE_3D vertex functions went by the handles and
	lost them, as out_dxf did before.

	* src/dwg_api.c (polyline_next_vertex): New, by dwg_next_entity, with
	a step limit against a cyclic chain.
	(dwg_object_polyline_2d_get_numpoints, polyline_2d_vertices_r13)
	(dwg_object_polyline_3d_get_numpoints)
	(dwg_object_polyline_3d_get_points): Use it.

