2026-11-15  Saddam  <saddamr3e@gmail.com>

	dwggrep: do not match converted UTF-8 text as UCS-2
	The no-PCRE2_16 MATCH_TYPE and match_LTYPE convert the r2007+ strings
	to UTF-8 first, but passed is16=1 to do_match. pcre2_match_16 then
	scanned the UTF-8 bytes as UTF-16, and print_match ran bit_convert_TU
