2026-11-14  Reini Urban  <reini.urban@gmail.com>

	decode_r2007: thumbnail.size keeps the END sentinel, like r2004
	The r2007 preview size excluded both sentinels, but the DXF writer and
	the encoder expect the r2004 convention: the size from the offset 16,
	including the END sentinel. So the DXF output dropped 16 bytes of each
	valid thumbnail, and the encoder wrote no END sentinel when converting
	r2007 to r2004. Also part of GHSA-63vm-xrm5-37jj.

