	Write LWPOLYLINE to pre-R13 as POLYLINE with VERTEXes (GH #1386)
	Pre-R13 has no LWPOLYLINE, it was skipped.  Before a pre-R13 DWG is
	encoded from an R13+ source, convert each LWPOLYLINE in place to a
	POLYLINE_2D with its VERTEX_2Ds and SEQEND.  The points, bulges, widths,
