2026-11-14  Reini Urban  <reini.urban@gmail.com>

	Keep the entities after a block POLYLINE, resolve ownerless sub-entities
	R2000 -> r2000 dropped every entity following a POLYLINE inside a block:
	the next_entity chain runs through the vertices, which are owned by the
	POLYLINE.  get_next_owned_block_entity and get_next_owned_entity took
	that for the end of the block, and returned NULL.  Skip the sub-entities,
