2026-11-07  Reini Urban  <reini.urban@gmail.com>

	encode: write R2000 from newer (and R13/R14) drawings as AutoCAD does
	Checked by rewriting ACadSharp's sample_AC1014..AC1032 (AutoCAD's own
	saves of one drawing) as R2000 and reading them with ACadSharp, against
	AutoCAD's own sample_AC1015.dwg. Not needed anymore, or fixed here:

	- VERTEX and ATTRIB links: R2004+ keeps the owned entities in a handle
	  list, R13-R2000 in a chain. first_vertex/first_attrib were written as
	  null. A pre-pass builds first/last from the lists, as absolute handles
	  (code 4) like AutoCAD, not relative.
	- EED strings of r2007+ sources: the codepage was written little-endian
	  (0x1E00), the length was that of the UTF-16 string, and the buffer
	  checks were inverted. Now RS_BE, the converted length.
	- MTEXT of R13/R14 sources: no line spacing in R2000+, a 0 collapses the
	  lines. Default 1 and 1.0 when writing pre-R2000.
	- LAYER of R13/R14 sources: no plot flag and lineweight. Default plot
	  and DEFAULT when writing pre-R2000.
	- Names: BYBLOCK, BYLAYER, CONTINUOUS, STANDARD, *ACTIVE of R13/R14
	  become ByBlock, ByLayer, Continuous, Standard, *Active, also the
	  dictionary keys, as AutoCAD's R2000 saves.
	- Colors: the r2004+ entity color (ENC) has no method byte, so every
	  ByBlock entity became ByLayer. A true color now keeps the ACI index
	  next to it, else the nearest palette color, not the low byte. The ACI
	  palette (rgb_palette) is now AutoCAD's table (agrees with ezdxf,
	  ACadSharp in 251 of 256 entries); the one common_test value follows.
	- Lineweight of R13/R14 entity sources: 0 (0.00 mm), now ByLayer.
	- MLINESTYLE lines: R2018+ keeps the linetype as handle, earlier as
	  index. The handle is now converted (ByLayer 32767, ByBlock 32766,
	  CONTINUOUS 0, else the position in LTYPE_CONTROL).
	- MTEXT line breaks and gradients: LF of newer sources is written as
	  \P as AutoCAD does; a gradient HATCH becomes a solid fill (R2000 has
	  no gradients).

	All six sample_AC1014..AC1032 rewritten as R2000 are read by ACadSharp
	with no error and 146 entities, the same as AutoCAD's own sample_AC1015.

	The remaining PR item (LWPOLYLINE vertex id flag) is already correct.
	LWPOLYLINE flags equal AutoCAD's save.

	* src/encode.c (upconvert_standard_names, link_owned_entities,
	  fix_mtext_hatch): New pre-passes.
	  (dwg_encode_eed_data): RS_BE codepage, converted length, buffer checks.
	* src/dwg.spec (MTEXT, LAYER, MLINESTYLE): The defaults and the index.
	* src/common_entity_data.spec (linewt): ByLayer from pre-R2000.
	* src/bits.c (bit_downconvert_CMC): ENC and true color index,
	  nearest_aci.
