	* test/unit-testing/common_test.c: follows the new palette.

2026-11-07  Reini Urban  <reini.urban@gmail.com>

	escape: do not read past an unterminated MTEXT format code
	mtext_plaintext skipped the inline codes \S \A \C \H \Q \T \W \F \p up to
	the terminating ';' and then stepped over the character it stopped at.
	A code without ';' at the end of the string stops at the NUL, the extra
	step went one byte past it and the outer loop read past the buffer
	(heap-buffer-overflow with ASan, found with dwg2SVG on an MTEXT ending in
	"\H2.5"). Do not step past the terminator.

	Reported-by: saddamr3e

	* programs/escape.c (mtext_plaintext): Guard the advance.
	* test/unit-testing/common_test.c (escape_mtext_plaintext_tests): New,
	  with exactly sized strings for ASan.

