	Add the ACIDBLOCKREFERENCE entity, read and write Inventor's blocks
	Inventor drawings place their sheet contents via AcIdBlockReference
	entities, an AcDbBlockReference with the layout of an INSERT. They were
	UNKNOWN_ENT and so dropped. Read them as the new native entity
	ACIDBLOCKREFERENCE, which keeps its class and DXF name, and share all
