	DWG_ENTITY (INSERT) and DWG_ENTITY (ACIDBLOCKREFERENCE). The type is
	Dwg_Entity_ACIDBLOCKREFERENCE, the same struct as INSERT, as with the
	UNDERLAYs. All places which test for an INSERT, e.g. to find its
	attribs or its owner for a SEQEND, now also accept it.

