	geojson: write block attributes as properties
	As asked in GH #849, the attributes of an INSERT or MINSERT were missing
	in GeoJSON. Each ATTRIB is now written as a "TAG": "value" property of its
	INSERT, an empty value as "". A tag repeating a key of the feature or an
	earlier tag is skipped, so the JSON keys stay unique. The ATTRIBs are
