	out_dxf: emit an ACAD_PROXY_ENTITY for unparseable classes
	An entity whose class LibreDWG cannot parse (UNKNOWN_ENT - Civil 3D road
	objects, custom-application entities) was returned as
	DWG_ERR_UNHANDLEDCLASS by dwg_dxf_object and vanished from the DXF
	entirely, taking its proxy graphics with it. ODA-based converters instead
	preserve it as an ACAD_PROXY_ENTITY carrying the graphics blob, so viewers
	draw the geometry even without the object enabler.

