	add_ent_preview, so the DXF still round-trips through dxf2dwg. One
	subtlety: group 95 must be emitted decimal, not hex - dxf_read_rl parses
	it decimal, and a hex value desyncs the reader.

	The class data section (group 93 stream + its object-id reference lists)
	is not emitted: it is not reconstructible without parsing the class, and
	is useless to a reader without the object enabler anyway.

