2026-11-03  Reini Urban  <reini.urban@gmail.com>

	in_dxf: keep counts equal to the arrays they count
	The DXF importer let a later group code set three counts again after
	the array they count was allocated. The count then no longer matched
	the array, and everything that walks the array to the count (encode,
	out_dxf, out_json, dwg_free, and for MLINE the importer itself) went
	past it.

	LTYPE.numdashes (73): add_LTYPE_dashes allocates dashes for the
	current numdashes at the first 49. A 73 after the dashes went to the
	generic field setter, whose "already set" check covers only num_*
	fields, and changed numdashes without touching dashes. If the 49
	came before any 73, the array was even 0 bytes. new_object now
	handles LTYPE 73 itself, and ignores it, with an error, once the
	dashes are allocated or numdashes is set.

	MLINE.num_lines (73): the 73 handler allocated the lines of each
	vertex once, and refused a second 73 only when num_lines was not 0.
	A 73 0 after the 72 allocated 0-element lines arrays, so a second
	73 2 got through, set num_lines to 2 and did not allocate, because
	verts[0].lines was already set. The 74 that followed wrote
	lines[0] into the 0-byte array. Now add_MLINE allocates no lines
	for a num_lines of 0, and refuses a 73 once the lines are
	allocated.

	An entity's preview_size (160): before r2010 the preview size is
	group 92, and add_ent_preview allocates the preview with it. A 160
	in such a file was taken as the plain common field preview_size:
	after a 92 1 and its 310, a 160 3000 made the size 3000 with a
	1-byte preview, and dxf2dwg copied 3000 bytes from it into the DWG.
	Now an entity's 160 goes to add_ent_preview in every version, is
	ignored, with an error, once the entity has a preview, as a
	duplicate 310 already is. add_ent_preview also resets a size it
	rejects, instead of keeping it with the old preview.

	New test test_dxf_count_resets: LTYPE with a second 73 after its
	dashes, MLINE with a 73 0 before its real 73, and a POINT preview
	160 in r2000 with a duplicate 160 and a rejected size. On master
	dwg_free aborts, freeing past the LTYPE dashes.

