	    common data, the full MTEXT field set (MTEXT field/handle order,
	    R2018 bg mask) and, when is_not_annotative, the R2018
	    AnnotScaleObject. Handles not stored in the struct (owner, ltype,
	    material, shadow, plotstyle) are read and discarded.

