	in_dxf: fix double-free in codepage conversion realloc-fail path
	When bit_utf8_to_TV keeps failing and a growth realloc then fails, the
	loop did free(tv); break;, leaving tv dangling. The subsequent else
	free(tv) then double-freed it (caught as -Werror=use-after-free by the
	mips GCC). Null out tv after the free so the final else free(tv) is a
	no-op free(NULL).

	* src/in_dxf.c (dxf_read_pair, DWG_VT_STR case): set tv = NULL after
	  freeing it in the realloc-failure branch.

