	spec: fix PROXY_ENTITY/PROXY_OBJECT DWG layout per ODA 20.4.90
	The refactored PROXY specs read a proxy_id (BL) first, but ODA 20.4.90
	has no proxy_id field in the DWG stream at all: R2000+ stores the Class
	ID (BL, dxf 91) right after the common data, then the version fields,
