2026-10-29  Reini Urban  <reini.urban@gmail.com>

	decode_r2007: don't leave hdl_dat dangling after header read
	read_2007_section_header shallow-copies sec_dat into the caller's
	hdl_dat, then frees sec_dat.chain, leaving hdl_dat->chain dangling and
	passed on to read_2007_section_handles and dwg_decode_add_object. The
	stale pointer is currently not dereferenced, but is a latent
	use-after-free. Detach the alias after the header variables are decoded.

	* src/decode_r2007.c (read_2007_section_header): Reset hdl_dat->chain
	  and size before freeing sec_dat.

	Fixes GH #1470

