2026-10-28  garcialeal  <garcialeal2@gmail.com>

	geom: integration of V4 spatial and SVG 2D transformation pipeline
	V4 refers to the Klein four-group (V4 ≅ Z2 x Z2), not a DWG version or a 4D
	vector/quaternion.

	In this context, V4 provides the 4x4 integer butterfly matrix (H_V4) over the coprime
	residue lattice S12 = {1, 5, 7, 11} (mod 12). This enables a zero-multiplication pipeline
	(using integer additions, subtractions, and bit-shifts) for fast 2D/3D spline
	quantization and spatial transformation.

	Closes GH #1405, see also GH #1400

