	spec: ASSOC2DCONSTRAINTGROUP num_nodes is next_node_id
	The BL after the actions list is an id seed, not an array length. Deleted
	nodes leave it larger than the number of nodes. Reading it as a REPEAT count
	failed on every sample ("Invalid nodes[rcount1].connections size").

