	status, a table of class names, and a list of {flag, class index, node id}
	entries, followed by the node bodies in registry order. Decode the registry
	header. The node bodies are not decoded yet, they stay in the unknown bits.
	Before r2013 (inline nodes with a class name each) is not decoded either.

