	bit_write_TU32: convert a TV source to UCS-2 for r2007+ targets
	bit_write_TU32 chose the UCS-2 branch by the target version alone and
	then measured the string with bit_wcs2len. The string is only UCS-2
	when it came from an r2007+ DWG (IS_FROM_TU); from JSON, DXF or a
	pre-r2007 DWG it is still an 8-bit TV, so bit_wcs2len read 16-bit
