	r2018 rewrite wrote the UCS-2 features as single bytes and "Acad:Text"
	read back as "A".

	Convert a non-UCS-2 source with bit_utf8_to_TU first, as bit_write_T16
	already does, and write the 16-bit units through a BITCODE_TU pointer.

	* src/bits.c (bit_write_TU32): Convert a TV source for r2007+ targets,
	  index the UCS-2 units.

