	decode: accept compressed sections larger than num_sections * max_decomp_size
	read_2004_compressed_section() rejected sections whose total size is
	larger than num_sections * max_decomp_size. Large AcDsPrototype_1b
	(ACIS datastorage) sections in r2013+ files can have this layout, so
