	in_dxf: fix five field misread bugs
	Five independent in_dxf bugs found importing AutoCAD/ezdxf DXFs:

	1. DIMENSION group 16/26/36 (arc definition point) aborted import for
	   subtypes without xline2end_pt (DIMENSION_ANG3PT).  Skip gracefully.

