	   branch excluded j==0 which still needed .y/.z for the first point.
	   Change to j>=0, increment j for 2D points, and properly reset j.

	5. Setting only a point's .x leaked stale .y/.z from a previous field
	   write.  Read the existing field value before overwriting .x only.

