	in_dxf: use code 4 for BLOCK_HEADER.entities[] owned handles
	When rebuilding a block's owned-entity list during DXF import, each
	entity was pushed onto BLOCK_HEADER.entities[] with handle relation
	code 3 (hard owner), but the encoder writes that vector as a soft
	pointer: HANDLE_VECTOR(entities, num_owned, 4, 0). On re-encode every
	owned entity therefore triggered

