	3DSOLID: read/write ACIS wire color as BS, not BL
	The ACIS wireframe wires[].color field was read as a plain BL for
	R2004+. The common value 256 (BYLAYER) is encoded with the 2-bit code
	11, which bit_read_BL flags as 'unexpected 2-bit code' (it returns 256
	but the read/write is asymmetric: bit_write_BL(256) emits 32 bits, so
	a re-encoded object no longer matches the original).

