	did): bit_read_BS/bit_write_BS treat code 11 = 256 as a valid value,
	symmetrically (2 bits each way). Fixes 12 false errors on
	test-data/2004/Surface.dwg and the round-trip asymmetry, for the whole
	3DSOLID family (3DSOLID/REGION/BODY/surfaces). No regression.

