	GITHUB_HEAD_REF, CI_COMMIT_REF_NAME, CI_COMMIT_BRANCH) or, as a
	fallback, `git rev-parse --abbrev-ref HEAD`, and report a todo()
	instead of asserting on a mismatch there.

