	Fix R2004 decompression buffer overflows (GH #1254, #1255, #1251)
	Two related bugs caused heap-buffer-overflows during R2004 section
	decompression:

	2. read_2004_compressed_section set dec.size larger than the actual
	   calloc allocation when es.fields.address + info->max_decomp_size
	   exceeded max_decomp_size.  The decompressor then wrote past the
