2026-05-16  Reini Urban  <reini.urban@gmail.com>

	Fix dwg_bmp thumbnail overflow checks (GH #1252, #1255)
	Several overflow checks in dwg_bmp were incorrect:

	* The check `osize > (dat.size - 4)` could underflow when dat.size < 4
	  because dat.size is size_t (unsigned).  Add `dat.size < 5` guard.

	* The loop guard `dat.byte > dat.size` used strict greater-than, allowing
	  reads when dat.byte == dat.size.  Use >= instead.

	* The BMP size check `*size > (dat.size - 4)` did not account for bytes
	  already consumed by header entries.  Check against `dat.size - dat.byte`.

	* The final overflow check `header_size + *size > dat.size` did not account
	  for the header entry bytes already consumed.  Check `dat.byte + *size`.

	src/dwg.c (dwg_bmp): Fix all four checks.

	Co-Authored-by: Kimi-k2.6 <kimi@moonshot.cn>

