2026-03-23  Reini Urban  <reini.urban@gmail.com>

	dwg_insert_entity: fix entity linking for loaded empty blocks
	When a DWG is loaded from file, BLOCK_HEADER.first_entity is a
	non-NULL pointer to a null handle (absolute_ref=0), not a NULL
	pointer. The previous !_owner->first_entity check failed in this
	case, so first_entity was never updated and prev/next_entity links
	were not set on the added entity.

	Fix the condition to also check absolute_ref, set both prev_entity
	and next_entity to null handles (code 4) for the first entity in
	a block, and set nolinks=0. Also set next_entity=null for any new
	last entity in the else branch, and add a fallback to update
	first_entity when adding to a loaded empty block.

	Fixes GH #1105

