2026-03-22  Reini Urban  <reini.urban@gmail.com>

	split dwg.spec into dwg.spec + dwg2.spec to reduce compile times
	Split the 12,801-line dwg.spec at the FIELDLIST/GEODATA boundary into
	two halves. encode.c and decode.c each get a companion *2.c file that
	compiles the second half with non-static functions, roughly halving
	their .o sizes (encode: 23MB->13MB, decode: 20MB->14MB).

	Other consumers (free, print, out_dxf, out_dxfb, out_json) simply
	include both spec files.  Shared macros (COMMON_ENTITY_DIMENSION,
	WIRESTRUCT_fields, 3DSOLID helpers, TABLE_value_fields) live in the
	new dwg_spec_shared.h.  Encode field macros extracted to enc_macros.h.

	Fixes GH #353

